    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Desktop has a strong editorial hierarchy, disciplined dark palette, and convincing cyan/red semantic accents. Tablet remains coherent, but the stacked artifact becomes tall. Mobile loses polish: the red evidence panel is cramped, text wraps heavily, the two outcome cells collapse awkwardly, background content competes with foreground copy, and the page becomes excessively long. The global header also feels truncated at tablet/mobile, with faint tiny navigation and the brand label disappearing on mobile.",
